| The mixed build: TORCS (an ELF program, run by !SharedLibs) has UnixLib
| inside it but loads OpenGL, EGL, GLU, freeglut, SDL 2 and OpenAL from
| !MesaLibs, shared with other programs. Where the RISC3D module has a
| driver (RISC OS on Linux with riscos-risc3d), they draw with the GPU.
| It needs !SharedLibs with ld-riscos/so/2 (GCCSDK 8 or later, as in Iris)
| and !MesaLibs (riscos-mesa 20.3.5-19 or later), both in !Boot.Resources.
If "<SharedLibs$Dir>" = "" Then IfThere Boot:Resources.!SharedLibs.!Boot Then Run Boot:Resources.!SharedLibs.!Boot
If "<MesaLibs$Dir>" = "" Then IfThere Boot:Resources.!MesaLibs.!Boot Then Run Boot:Resources.!MesaLibs.!Boot
Unset TORCS$SO2
IfThere SharedLibs:lib.ld-riscos-eabihf/so Then Set TORCS$SO2 1
If "<TORCS$SO2>" = "" Then Error TORCS needs a !SharedLibs with ld-riscos/so/2 (GCCSDK 8 or later, as in Iris) in !Boot.Resources
Unset TORCS$SO2
If "<MesaLibs$Dir>" = "" Then Error TORCS needs !MesaLibs (riscos-mesa 20.3.5-19 or later) in !Boot.Resources
| Where the loader finds the libraries.
Set TORCS$LD$Env "LD_LIBRARY_PATH=/MesaLibs:"
| *Set LIBGL_ALWAYS_SOFTWARE 1 before starting TORCS draws in software
| even where RISC3D could use the GPU (it applies to every OpenGL program
| until *Unset).

| The program is loaded into the slot; its heap goes in dynamic areas.
WimpSlot -min 16000K -max 16000K
| Do: Run doesn't expand <variables> in its arguments.
Do Run <TORCS$Dir>.TORCS <TORCS$Options>
